==Description==

A CfdOF Analysis is a Container that holds all objects of a Computational Fluid Dynamic Analysis. It is mandatory to have this container.

==Usage==

# There are several ways to invoke the command:
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:CfdOF_analysis.svg|16px]] [[CfdOF_Analysis|Analysis container]]‏‎}} Analysis container button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|CfdOF → [[Image:CfdOF_analysis.svg|16px]] Analysis container‏‎}} option from the menu.
#* Use the keyboard shortcut: {{KEY|N}} then {{KEY|C}}.
# A new Analysis is created and set to active.
# The following child objects are automatically created within the Analysis container:
#*[[Image:CfdOF_Physics_Model.svg|16px]] [[CfdOF_Physics_Model|PhysicsModel]] 
#*[[Image:CfdOF_Fluid_Properties.svg|16px]] [[CfdOF_Fluid_Properties|FluidProperties]] 
#*[[Image:CfdOF_Initialise_Flow_Fields.svg|16px]] [[CfdOF_Initialise_Flow_Fields|InitialiseFields]]
#*[[Image:CfdOF_CFD_Solver.svg|16px]] [[CfdOF_CFD_Solver|CfdSolver]]
# Additional objects can be added to the Analysis container by pressing a CfdOF button or selecting from the CfdOF menu.


